      "response": "{\"status\":200,\"message\":\"Desktop session result.\",\"result\":{\"data\":{\"aside_id\":\"b27f1192-f060-472c-a8bb-ce89e5b45027\",\"text\":\"Transport failures and owner **5xx** responses, per provider, inside a moving window.\\n\\n- each transport failure spends one\\n- each owner 5xx spends one\\n- a retry that succeeds resets the window\\n\\nA **4xx** never spends it: the request was wrong, not the provider.\",\"off_record\":true},\"replayed\":false}}"
